   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Verb and noun",
     "texto": [
      "Instead of **efter at undersøgelsen blev afsluttet** (after the study was finished) one says **efter afslutningen af undersøgelsen** (after the completion of the study).",
      "Verbs become nouns with suffixes: **afslutte → afslutning** (to finish → completion), **undersøge → undersøgelse** (to investigate → investigation)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "What changes",
     "texto": [
      "The noun can be followed by a complement with **af** to show which action or topic is meant: **afslutningen af undersøgelsen** = the completion of the study.",
      "It's more common in the press and official documents."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
